# The left stick's click as the menu button when the runtime binds no left menu button (SteamVR with Touch
# controllers; 0.1.1 list item 4). Expect in run.log: "[vr-pad] Start: the left stick's click pressed" once, at the
# title's PRESS START; the VR menu opened by the click held a second over the title's menu ("the left menu button held
# in a menu") and closed by the next click; and no Start from the two sticks clicked together (a recentre).
1 menu_unbound 1
900 shot title
1200 left_click 1
1206 left_click 0
1500 shot after-start
1800 left_click 1
1890 left_click 0
1950 shot vr-menu
2100 left_click 1
2106 left_click 0
2250 shot vr-menu-closed
2400 left_click 1
2403 right_click 1
2412 left_click 0
2413 right_click 0
2600 shot after-recentre
2700 quit 0
